    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d775">

                <pb facs="0885" n="1719" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1719"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/11172</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Willard</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-30T13:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 30, 1918, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received August 31, 4.25
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Embassy’s August 30, noon.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d775-f1"/> Minister of Foreign
                    Affairs requested me to obtain telegraphically from my Government replies to
                    following questions: (1) How were Germans in America treated upon severance of
                    relations? (2) How were they treated after declaration of war? (3) Upon
                    severance of relations what steps were taken with respect to German ships in
                    American ports? (4) Upon declaration of war what steps were taken with respect
                    to these ships?<anchor n="2" xml:id="d775-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Willard</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d775-f1" n="1" xml:id="d775-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d775-f2" n="2" xml:id="d775-f2-content">
                <p>Reply of Oct. 4, telegram No. 1642, giving information requested, not
                    printed.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
